# data/generated/ is intentionally NOT ignored: students.json, conversations.json,
# and wellbeing.db are the pre-baked synthetic dataset (small, ~1MB total) and
# are committed on purpose so a deployed server has data without needing to
# run the ~80-minute scripts/seed_db.py regeneration at deploy time. If you
# regenerate locally and only want to commit an intentional refresh, review
# `git diff --stat data/generated/` before committing.
